[{"title":"买蛩 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"秋蛩虽细小，惨毒尔何安。\n聚族逾千命，呼鸡罄一餐。\n世情唯鲁莽，吾意悯贪残。\n买纵梧阴下，天全戢羽翰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10356,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"买蛩 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"乍似潜阴砌，旋疑隔曲房。\n哀鸣声远近，明月夜苍凉。\n客梦秋长醒，清心听不妨。\n东山嗤谢傅，丝竹近淫荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10357,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋雨后访沙门无垢","author":"戴亨","text":"披襟怜霁色，仰首爱天容。\n溽暑沈宵雨，新凉散候蛩。\n茅堂寻野衲，石径度深松。\n尘外清谈永，寥寥响梵钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10358,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆西山简乔梅庵","author":"戴亨","text":"沧海何年去，渔樵乐此生。\n自闻高隐处，每动出尘情。\n老树经霜色，悬泉落涧声。\n秋来多胜事，羡尔遂躬耕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10359,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿僧舍","author":"戴亨","text":"访衲过精舍，身轻翠蔼中。\n云根泉吐月，松顶鹤翔风。\n欹枕浑无寐，清心闻夜钟。\n悄然思古德，垂老半归空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10360,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"飘泊无家客，乾坤一讲堂。\n钟魂摇梦醒，槐荫泼阶凉。\n岁月三秋逼，关河万里长。\n此身何处著，搔首问穹苍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10361,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"世际羲轩盛，身惭稷契良。\n幽青新旱厉，淮海旧怀襄。\n沧水何年使，桑林近日禳。\n文章思报国，此意竟荒唐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10362,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"明主巡方切，贤臣补衮殷。\n睿谟崇帝舜，折槛有朱云。\n远猎威胡虏，虔禋报祖勋。\n荒寒边徼外，深念圣躬勤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10363,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"所学终何用，空馀泽畔吟。\n徘徊千古业，孤负一生心。\n秋老黄花悴，风回落叶深。\n感时还自惜，霜雪鬓毛侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10364,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"孤立安时命，遑知拙与工。\n问心期不愧，入世岂求同。\n风力抟鹰翮，霜威损桂丛。\n烟霞沧海外，脉脉系初衷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10365,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其六","author":"戴亨","text":"衰谢尘心尽，琴尊野兴长。\n人情秋藻丽，吾意古苔凉。\n引杖随溪水，看云度石梁。\n足缨思遍濯，清浊问沧浪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10366,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其七","author":"戴亨","text":"瓠落竟何似，浮踪浊水萍。\n那堪孤客况，不尽九秋情。\n夜月蒹葭色，寒窗蟋蟀声。\n长公头未白，归去早埋名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10367,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赏菊","author":"戴亨","text":"华堂虚位置，低彩自荣鲜。\n霜力催无恙，人言服得仙。\n乾坤钟晚节，孤洁类高贤。\n萝薜谁家圃，吾将老一椽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10368,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋郊纵目","author":"戴亨","text":"广野开晴旭，襟怀扩远天。\n轻雷山脚雨，空翠寺门烟。\n秋老茱萸节，人閒草木年。\n一尊当夕照，红叶下前川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10369,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"戴亨","text":"高旷平生志，艰辛老不移。\n深秋如有恨，久客始能知。\n归雁声何苦，中宵泪欲垂。\n关河无限路，随尔到天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10370,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日简毛秋岑明复庵","author":"戴亨","text":"志士悲年迅，重阳节又临。\n欲寻黄叶路，高寄白云心。\n惠子濠梁乐，荣期带索吟。\n芳踪谁可继，怀古意何深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10371,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题明复庵别业","author":"戴亨","text":"为吏兼为圃，园蔬每自耘。\n偶来前浦雨，多是近山云。\n羡尔亲林壑，惭余滞俗氛。\n种瓜思结耦，小筑傍榆枌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10372,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答巢六国学世馨即用原韵 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"世情轻道义，交际复谁真。\n硕德思前辈，论心笃后尘。\n乾坤三大业，今古百年人。\n此意孤悬久，逢君倍觉亲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10373,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答巢六国学世馨即用原韵 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"生涯馀白发，世缔得同心。\n乍见惊余老，雄谈识尔忱。\n孤鸣琴已碎，苦诣道方深。\n何处求真赏，寥寥太古音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10374,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再赠巢六世馨","author":"戴亨","text":"大块敦庞气，偏于尔独钟。\n九重陶伟器，万卷扩奇胸。\n通塞天君泰，艰虞道味醲。\n惭余衰朽质，深望后凋松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10375,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惊秋","author":"戴亨","text":"几时不出户，已遍帝城秋。\n贞脆荣枯递，江河日夜流。\n惧孤天地德，深感岁时遒。\n莫谓分阴志，专为运甓谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10376,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日郊行","author":"戴亨","text":"登眺林皋霁，萧森霜露馀。\n一从遭斥逐，深喜近樵渔。\n芦雪人家岸，槐烟野衲居。\n置身图画里，随步得相于。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10377,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"国进士云浦斋中检得骑都尉白鹤亭旧诗数纸笔意迥异时蹊即同过访二首 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"大雅谁能继，孤吟动感伤。\n篇章搜故纸，金石振华堂。\n年少能如此，功深岂易量。\n平生轻薄意，见尔觉荒唐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10378,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"国进士云浦斋中检得骑都尉白鹤亭旧诗数纸笔意迥异时蹊即同过访二首 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"宦途经蹭蹬，一笑拂尘襟。\n霜重鸿飞远，山空豹隐深。\n青灯终古业，白首访君心。\n不弃他山石，乾坤是赏音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10379,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠舒进士乃来","author":"戴亨","text":"少壮成名日，文章报国心。\n奇书资锐讨，精理渥灵襟。\n邂逅惭余老，风尘契汝深。\n孤鸣人境外，倾耳听希音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10380,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆松","author":"戴亨","text":"矫矫虬龙势，亭亭数寸阴。\n讵知霜烈日，独抱岁寒心。\n老石嶙峋白，苍根礧砢深。\n无材堪大用，乌几伴枯吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10381,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再咏盆松","author":"戴亨","text":"妖矫盆中势，萧森几上阴。\n根株年久固，霜雪岁寒深。\n寂寞安贫日，峥嵘未老心。\n临风时对尔，音响入鸣琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10382,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明惺斋招余偕隐沧洲","author":"戴亨","text":"我厌尘情秽，君耽遁世高。\n青山留傲骨，沧海壮诗涛。\n禾黍占晴雨，园蔬自桔槔。\n相偕成沮溺，回首笑空劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10383,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭明惺斋三首 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"夜梦方疑信，晨兴报溘亡。\n穷途谁我重，交谊独君长。\n风雅坛空在，烟霞愿未偿。\n他时听玉笛，何忍赋山阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10384,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭明惺斋三首 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"十载论交地，千秋此德邻。\n升沈终不易，道义老逾真。\n久病欣方减，新诗觉有神。\n如何违数日，仓卒失斯人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10385,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭明惺斋三首 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"交道今谁重，斯文世所轻。\n艰难羁客泪，生死哭君情。\n惨雪迷归路，沧波空旧盟。\n那堪招隐句，吟作断肠声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10386,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送六给谏居鲁巡察台湾 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"岂有千秋望，空耽数卷书。\n谩将屈蠖地，错拟卧龙居。\n谋道亲樵牧，虚怀媲古初。\n感君骢马客，三次到荒庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10387,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送六给谏居鲁巡察台湾 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"旧识疏贫贱，新知正阒寥。\n白头甘濩落，青眼重箪瓢。\n朔雪燕城暗，云帆瘴海遥。\n那堪情始洽，离席祖星轺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10388,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送六给谏居鲁巡察台湾 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"应运生申甫，乘时荐马阳。\n谠言谟诰协，忧国鬓须苍。\n海角敷功烈，葵心注庙堂。\n所嗟贤补阙，迢递出蛮方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10389,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送六给谏居鲁巡察台湾 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"台湾闽海外，奉命代巡行。\n旌节三年驻，云山万里程。\n乘骢臣子义，别泪故人情。\n计日徯回棹，衔杯续旧盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10390,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新春书怀","author":"戴亨","text":"不揽范滂辔，从挥祖逖鞭。\n名山留大业，吾学慕前贤。\n白发争先后，新诗记岁年。\n所伤时屡易，江海意空悬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10391,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子正月八日重馆竹梧轩","author":"戴亨","text":"壮志销磨尽，他乡老病俱。\n还搜残卷帙，重课旧生徒。\n天地苏群动，饥寒困腐儒。\n厚生怜八口，吾道乏良图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10392,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新正访舒乃来不遇","author":"戴亨","text":"独坐理瑶琴，空鸣太始音。\n出城寻故识，策马度荒林。\n霭霭檐前日，嘤嘤窗外禽。\n相思不相见，归路感何深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10393,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后讲席示诸生","author":"戴亨","text":"竹梧新讲席，冰雪旧文坛。\n业进心逾怯，功深道觉难。\n阳春回黍谷，时雨润芳兰。\n默默和风转，青灯莫畏寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将出南郊看桃花先简明复庵","author":"戴亨","text":"每为娱吾性，南郊匹马过。\n竹篱春圃外，沙屿野鸥多。\n已觉非尘市，兼之足啸歌。\n谁能忘此地，花信近如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"简同人","author":"戴亨","text":"云豁南郊路，名园拟畅游。\n绿蓑渔舍雨，青旆酒家楼。\n俗虑澄秋水，孤情托野鸥。\n年华看旅雁，又过白蘋洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题孟颖仙治平略后","author":"戴亨","text":"万姓食为天，风淳赖养先。\n均平怀往政，兼并抑何年。\n饱暖忧禽兽，饥寒困圣贤。\n古今商治理，遗轨在斯篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨窗独咏","author":"戴亨","text":"喜听连朝雨，耽吟五字诗。\n叩门无俗物，凿句有奇思。\n鹤唳千寻岫，蚕抽独茧丝。\n襟期谁与共，窗外绿梧知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新秋对月口占","author":"戴亨","text":"庭院早凉轻，临风恋夜晴。\n碧梧疏月影，哀角入云声。\n缥缈关河望，推迁岁月惊。\n诗成还自咏，展转动离情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏宝鼎","author":"戴亨","text":"三代调和器，胡为却在兹。\n金精谁解重，宗庙不终遗。\n饘粥恒于是，伛偻尚有词。\n函牛堪大受，少汁莫轻施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卢峰口","author":"戴亨","text":"险阨卢龙塞，经过一怆神。\n悲风吹战垒，白骨吊征人。\n月落喧狐语，山空耀鬼燐。\n前途投宿处，冉冉汨行尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悯流亡","author":"戴亨","text":"龙沙风雪道，资斧怯前程。\n忍见流亡像，哀闻乞命声。\n饥寒方切己，胞与复关情。\n我欲将图绘，风尘隔帝京。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁远州","author":"戴亨","text":"出关二百里，州治覆寒云。\n乱石堆墙短，流泉入圃分。\n野狼昏截径，山鬼夜呼群。\n问俗难投止，驱车背夕曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁远道中","author":"戴亨","text":"征轺超崱屴，落叶照沙尘。\n石险频惊马，山空偶见人。\n鸣鸿哀旷野，荒草白深春。\n此际逢歧路，凭谁一问津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经牧马场","author":"戴亨","text":"龙堆千里道，极目望茫茫。\n草木穷寒麓，风云惨大荒。\n地邻箕子国，居近管宁乡。\n有客怀南土，魂惊牧马场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"胡家窝铺","author":"戴亨","text":"险溺胡家铺，行人莫不闻。\n地顽常带卤，山蠢不生云。\n草滑埋蛇穴，风腥过虎群。\n往来经此处，踯躅畏斜曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陈家台述事","author":"戴亨","text":"岁俭多宵小，颓垣户牖通。\n既眠愁盗马，不寐听嘶风。\n岂是燕台骏，深惭塞上翁。\n晨兴看结蚓，骧首海云东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望北台早发","author":"戴亨","text":"晓起天无色，星光浸冷溪。\n荒榛塞古道，野戍听晨鸡。\n林黑椎埋匿，风生草树嘶。\n此心长惴惴，残梦逐轮蹄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿大石桥","author":"戴亨","text":"去家三十里，犹隔一宵程。\n两岸众峰敛，一钩新月明。\n近乡思愈切，久别恨旋生。\n不寐听残夜，荒鸡下五更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"述梦","author":"戴亨","text":"岂是尘寰境，宁无栖隐心。\n空香生绣陌，碧涧泻松阴。\n我欲桃源去，人言山径深。\n徘徊歧路侧，曙色动窗禽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉窆先二人后述哀","author":"戴亨","text":"风木悲今日，鸡豚尽此生。\n一抔黄土泪，终古北邙情。\n云起结愁色，溪流涌恨声。\n乳鸦思返哺，绕树但哀鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀都门诸友","author":"戴亨","text":"芍药期将过，安榴花复开。\n遥知清赏处，应念白头回。\n片月千山里，孤云万里来。\n相思情正剧，邻笛不胜哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀竹梧轩诸生并门人沈周颋","author":"戴亨","text":"远客情怀恶，出门日已多。\n诸生狂未减，瘦沈病如何。\n海角吹残戍，边风涌白波。\n长安斜照外，翘首望岩阿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别门人何公符兼谢厚贶","author":"戴亨","text":"失路同为客，君情迥出群。\n搜厨谋一饭，倾橐赆千文。\n梦绕辽疆月，心催汉戍云。\n那堪今日别，鱼雁莫稀闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与友人论诗","author":"戴亨","text":"旷代斯文责，肩兹若有神。\n讴吟恒自得，商榷定谁真。\n风雅将兴日，乾坤未死身。\n立言诚大业，天意属何人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"背阴铺遇雨","author":"戴亨","text":"日午增烦热，征途汗透冠。\n风生来骤雨，云起忽埋山。\n深慰农家望，旋愁行路难。\n赊程看旅橐，不寐听潺湲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将赴辽东约门人沈周颋摄馆事两月余归迟沈已如期去一月矣怅然有作","author":"戴亨","text":"远行念诸子，馆课尔堪招。\n作客身多病，怀亲路觉遥。\n梦回燕塞月，心折海门潮。\n归去瓜期届，予诚愧久要。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自辽东抵京往晤天峰云浦鹤亭即订西山之游得山字","author":"戴亨","text":"道路三千里，风尘百日还。\n盍簪欣晤语，林壑想追攀。\n孤鹤立寒渚，断云归远山。\n披襟同啸咏，俗虑净岩间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题步天峰韵","author":"戴亨","text":"西麓饶名胜，幽深别有天。\n官閒曾过赏，尘隔几经年。\n樵子石梁路，渔罾荻浦烟。\n相期蜡双屐，幽兴寄林泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜读书 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"断绝浮尘梦，支离世外居。\n青灯堪耐久，白发不违初。\n阴砌虫鸣露，寒更月照庐。\n功深风雨后，甘苦竟何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜读书 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"吾道残编在，秋斋翠色深。\n杜门如老衲，力学尚童心。\n霜叶鸣寒牖，风枝动夜禽。\n年来人事少，稽古遂抽簪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庭前残卉为秋风所捲唯寒蛩疏竹而已反觉清耳豁目","author":"戴亨","text":"荒秽驱风力，三秋贮月明。\n未归湖海棹，聊寄薜萝情。\n翠竹独居色，寒蛩夜坐声。\n寂喧随万感，心与境俱清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"羁客伤迟暮，隆冬发浩吁。\n市居惭大隐，讲席愧通儒。\n牢落精华铄，冰霜月夜孤。\n无裘难卒岁，掩卷意踟蹰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"身世馀残梦，琴书滞远天。\n严风摧万汇，衰骨凛深渊。\n久历炎凉境，今非少壮年。\n老安夫子愿，应倍悯寒毡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送年家子毛秋岑归窆祖茔余有同约至期不遂","author":"戴亨","text":"卜阡余负约，夙愿尔无违。\n洒我思乡泪，沾君返国衣。\n越江孤棹远，燕塞早鸿飞。\n有梦随荒麓，相携上翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]